<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Zugspitze Guide: 10 places – cog railway, Eibsee, gorges &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Zugspitze – Zahnradbahn hoch, Seilbahn runter</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go up early in the morning, then the view is best and the cable cars emptier. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>10.98561,47.42119,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Summit: view, glacier &amp; summit cross</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Check the webcams before leaving – clear visibility is everything. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>10.9863,47.42121,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Garmisch-Partenkirchen – Ludwigstraße &amp; Lüftlmalerei</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Use the town as a base – the railway starts here. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>11.11289,47.49248,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Olympic ski stadium &amp; large Olympic ski jump</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Combine the visit with the Partnach Gorge. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>11.1187,47.48034,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Partnachklamm</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come early, bring a jacket and check beforehand whether the gorge is open. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>11.12212,47.46465,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Badersee – the quiet moor lake</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come early or on a weekday – on hot weekends it is crowded. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>11.01635,47.47336,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Höllentalklamm – wilder than the Partnach Gorge</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Open only in summer – check weather and access beforehand. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>11.04092,47.44421,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Linderhof Palace &amp; Neuschwanstein as a day trip</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Reserve tickets online and start early. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/zugspitze/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>10.96076,47.57165,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
